      "writtenOn": "2026-10-08T17:48:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "When jumping from shipping RO to RW, sm5803_init() returns early at \u0027if (chip_inited[chgnum])\u0027 (line 635). Because shipping RO only enables SM5803_INT2_TINT in SM5803_REG_INT2_EN, SM5803_INT2_VBUS is never enabled after a sysjump and vbus_voltage_cache remains stale on disconnect. Consider ensuring SM5803_INT2_VBUS and the initial VBUS thresholds/cache are configured in the chip_inited path as well.",
      "isAi": true,
      "revId": "b3e65a92412bb020ed7fa5b7476fde2cdddb9176",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "878393a8_042baa7d",
